# Every environment variable this project needs, listed by name, with no values.
#
# Copy this file and fill in the real values:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored and must never be committed. This file IS committed, and is
# the only record of what a fresh machine needs in order to run the stack.
#
# Rule: any increment that introduces a new variable adds its name here in the
# same commit that introduces it.
#
# No variables yet. The database arrives in increment 1.2.
